Add comprehensive test suite for return processing and alert rules

- Introduced tests for alert rules validation using Prometheus' promtool.
- Added decision tests to cover previously skipped cases in the suite.
- Implemented end-to-end flow tests to validate the entire return process.
- Created tests for handling late events and malformed events.
- Developed replay tests to ensure consistent outcomes for identical event sequences.
- Established rule eligibility tests for return windows based on item categories.
- Added flagging tests for customers with excessive returns.
- Implemented idempotency tests to ensure refunds are processed correctly.
- Created pricing tests to validate refund amounts based on item grades.
- Developed state machine tests to verify item state transitions during the return process.
